<title>USA: Accom names Cal Hoagland CFO.</title>
<headline>Accom names Cal Hoagland CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accom Inc Wednesday named Cal Hoagland to the post of vice president for finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Hoagland recently served as Global and Corporate Controller at ADAC Laboratories, a leading medical imaging and healthcare information systems company.</p>
